      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ELECTRIC KUNA (2) was strongly fancied last time and hit the ground running with a sensational early split, giving a sight but could manage only second (22.01) at this track over 381m. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Winning claims. BARK LIGHTYEAR (5) was a winner two back when prominent throughout then got further back last time and could manage only a 6 length 4th at this track (22.43). The form out of last race has been strong. Can do much better this time. FEARLESS PARKER (4) copped a check in the run last time and never threatened when fourth (22.39) in a Grade 4/5 at this track. Has the ability and can atone with the right run. HANNAH'S PASSION (8) should be thereabouts after filling a top-three spot most recently.",
